# INVWINIA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: CTRL+E in the
# item form's view mode at level 3.  ENTER shows item 1 in view mode, its
# Close and Edit buttons; CTRL+E shows it again in edit mode, its values
# and notes as they were, OK and Cancel, the focus on its category, where
# F4 on the status opens the pick list of its codes, each with its name,
# and ESC on it unchanged asks nothing.  Item 2's model, changed after
# CTRL+E and saved by ENTER (OK), shows in the list fetched again, and the
# status bar says "Item 2 saved" until the next key.  CTRL+E with the
# focus on Close switches too, and item 3's notes of more than
# MEMO_MAXLINES lines stay read-only with INV's message in edit mode.  The
# Edit button, reached by SHIFT-TAB four times from the tab strip, past
# the identity row's model and maker and Help, switches item 1's form
# too; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINIA.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ENTER
S VIEW
K CTRL-E
S EDIT
K TAB F4
S DROPPED
K ESC ESC
S LEFT
# item 2: CTRL+E in view mode, then the model by its letter
K DOWN ENTER CTRL-E ALT-D
T TM100-5
K ENTER
S SAVED
K DOWN
S CLEARED
# item 3, the focus moved back from the strip past the model, the maker,
# Help and Edit onto Close
K ENTER STAB STAB STAB STAB STAB
S ONOK
K CTRL-E
S EDIT3
K ESC HOME ENTER STAB STAB STAB STAB SPACE
S EDITBTN
K ESC ALT-F X
